                "text": "",
                "latex": "\\begin{aligned} y(t)&=6e^{-6t}\\int_0^t e^{6\\tau}\\,d\\tau \\\\ &=6e^{-6t}\\left[\\frac{1}{6}e^{6\\tau}\\right]_0^t \\\\ &=e^{-6t}(e^{6t}-1) \\\\ &=1-e^{-6t}. \\end{aligned}",
